{"chapter": "etale-cohomology", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "03Q4", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "MATH_0001": "$(\\mathcal{F}_i, \\varphi_{ii'})$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0003": "$U \\mapsto \\colim_i \\mathcal{F}_i(U)$", "MATH_0004": "$U$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{F}(U) = \\colim \\mathcal{F}_i(U)$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{sites-lemma-colimit-sheaves}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{sites-lemma-directed-colimits-sections}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{sites-cohomology-lemma-colim-works-over-collection}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{sites-cohomology-lemma-colimit}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent", "STRUCT_0002": "\\medskip", "STRUCT_0003": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:66fb345001dfa384a527d0e4032328d6ee63a4873d2a940edf16d038c2ec8539", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:628ae5d8f71d19d625dc0ba316141f74226704a5fef09176224de194909e2ba2", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nWe recall that if <MATH_0001> is a diagram of sheaves on\na site <MATH_0002> its colimit (in the category of sheaves) is the\nsheafification of the presheaf <MATH_0003>. See\nSites, Lemma <REF_0001>.\nIf the system is directed, <MATH_0004> is a quasi-compact object of\n<MATH_0005> which has a cofinal system of coverings by quasi-compact\nobjects, then <MATH_0006>, see\nSites, Lemma <REF_0002>.\nSee Cohomology on Sites, Lemma\n<REF_0003>\nfor a result dealing with higher cohomology groups of colimits\nof abelian sheaves.\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\nIn Cohomology on Sites, Lemma <REF_0004>\nwe generalize this result to a system of sheaves\non an inverse system of sites. Here is the corresponding\nnotion in the case of a system of <ACCENT_0001>tale sheaves living\non an inverse system of schemes.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:85f0a4349ad6dcc75b79eeb3bb4fc7aceaad905f2d476637917f452bdf83fd56", "unit_id": "tag:03Q4:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "etale-cohomology", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "03Q4", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$I$", "MATH_0002": "$(X_i, f_{i'i})$", "MATH_0003": "$I$", "MATH_0004": "$(\\mathcal{F}_i, \\varphi_{i'i})$", "MATH_0005": "$(X_i, f_{i'i})$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{F}_i$", "MATH_0007": "$(X_i)_\\etale$", "MATH_0008": "$i \\in I$", "MATH_0009": "$i' \\geq i$", "MATH_0010": "$\\varphi_{i'i} : f_{i'i}^{-1}\\mathcal{F}_i \\to \\mathcal{F}_{i'}$", "MATH_0011": "$(X_{i'})_\\etale$", "MATH_0012": "$\\varphi_{i''i} = \\varphi_{i''i'} \\circ f_{i'' i'}^{-1}\\varphi_{i'i}$", "MATH_0013": "$i'' \\geq i' \\geq i$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-inverse-system-sheaves}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:fdaa45b3c18318946a87c8cee35ed40d6b83ad1165bf665ae1e49d9fa4b728b0", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f1326a746ae307815ebba31a9530ff541e61f967ce1440e947e5b91423962c74", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a preordered set. Let <MATH_0002> be an inverse\nsystem of schemes over <MATH_0003>.\nA <TEXTITOPEN_0001>system <MATH_0004> of sheaves\non <MATH_0005><TEXTITCLOSE_0001> is given by\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> a sheaf <MATH_0006> on <MATH_0007> for all <MATH_0008>,\n<STRUCT_0003> for <MATH_0009> a map\n<MATH_0010>\nof sheaves on <MATH_0011>\n<STRUCT_0004>\nsuch that <MATH_0012>\nwhenever <MATH_0013>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:bb531d400f08e19d9cc165e117410bda1783ce5cd97da797dd7d59b225b6555f", "unit_id": "tag:0EZL:statement"}
{"chapter": "etale-cohomology", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "03Q4", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$I$", "MATH_0002": "$f_{i'i}$", "MATH_0003": "$X = \\lim X_i$", "MATH_0004": "$f_i : X \\to X_i$", "MATH_0005": "$$\nf_i^{-1}\\mathcal{F}_i = f_{i'}^{-1}f_{i'i}^{-1}\\mathcal{F}_i\n\\xrightarrow{f_{i'}^{-1}\\varphi_{i'i}}\nf_{i'}^{-1}\\mathcal{F}_{i'}\n$$", "MATH_0006": "$f_i^{-1}\\mathcal{F}_i$", "MATH_0007": "$X_\\etale$", "MATH_0008": "$I$", "MATH_0009": "$$\nH^q_\\etale(X, \\colim f_i^{-1}\\mathcal{F}_i) =\n\\colim H^q_\\etale(X_i, \\mathcal{F}_i)\n$$", "MATH_0010": "$X_i$", "MATH_0011": "$i$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{definition-inverse-system-sheaves}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{limits-section-limits}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{theorem-colimit}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:59d6f1cefd409b4f3e5287776dbdd8e637ce29e1491e6c47bf38fe4661c2faae", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:ffe8e2d531481c2764e3013c9a422c4ed5a9743307cadd5aed60256105459d1f", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nIn the situation of Definition <REF_0001>,\nassume <MATH_0001> is a directed set and the transition morphisms <MATH_0002> affine.\nLet <MATH_0003> be the limit in the category of schemes, see\nLimits, Section <REF_0002>.\nDenote <MATH_0004> the projection morphisms and consider the maps\n<MATH_0005>\nThis turns <MATH_0006> into a system of sheaves on <MATH_0007>\nover <MATH_0008> (it is a good exercise to check this).\nWe often want to know whether there is an isomorphism\n<MATH_0009>\nIt will turn out this is true if <MATH_0010> is quasi-compact and quasi-separated\nfor all <MATH_0011>, see Theorem <REF_0003>.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c3fd41a5551364dc6f5364388168dcacaa002f2e5e441efdd3d85776f282eb3f", "unit_id": "tag:03Q4:prose-0002"}
